Server init.
>> a := Blob berria: 4.
a bytes: ( Zerrenda berria ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob berria: 4.
b bytes: ( Zerrenda berria ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a berria.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Irteera idatzi: ( a ^ c ), lerro-jauzia. } harrapatu: { :e Irteera idatzi: e, lerro-jauzia. }, hasi.
a askatu.
b askatu.
